```bash
sudo sshd -T | grep -E '^(port|listenaddress|permitrootlogin|passwordauthentication|pubkeyauthentication|kbdinteractiveauthentication)'
```

Initial configuration included:

```text
port 22
listenaddress [::]:22
listenaddress 0.0.0.0:22
